      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is antithetical to the way that udon networking works in VRChat currently, and probably won't be implemented anytime soon as it would require a complete rewrite of the networking codebase as well as requiring hosting active servers instead of the current networking relay setup that exists (as far as I understand it).",
