  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-18T15:04:12.771Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Create a way to make Udon Behaviours executed server-side (by putting the server as the default owner of objects for instance).\nThis would allow more stability for multiplayer games. It could reduce by twice the latency and solve the problems when the master goes afk or crashes.\nMoreover, it would simplify a lot the process of transferring the ownership while a game is running and the master leaves or crashes for example.",
